WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.298 --> 00:00:16.560
the animals were too sick to go home.

2
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:17.701
So Dr.

3
00:00:17.761 --> 00:00:19.362
Dolittle kept them in the house.

4
00:00:20.123 --> 00:00:21.784
His sister did not like that.

5
00:00:21.804 --> 00:00:26.488
"John! These animals must go!"

6
00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:27.669
she screamed.

7
00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:31.232
"But they're very sick, Sarah," he replied.

8
00:00:31.792 --> 00:00:32.773
"Give them medicine!

9
00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:33.833
I don't care!

10
00:00:33.853 --> 00:00:36.195
They can't stay in MY house!"

11
00:00:36.655 --> 00:00:37.315
she shouted.

12
00:00:40.057 --> 00:00:44.139
Dr. Dolittle didn't know it, but his life was about to change again.

13
00:00:44.159 --> 00:00:47.201
"Drink plenty of water," Dr.

14
00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:49.002
Dolittle told a goat one morning.

15
00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:52.103
"Hey! Are you the animal doc?"

16
00:00:52.624 --> 00:00:54.224
a big man shouted loudly.

17
00:00:57.126 --> 00:00:58.427
"Yes, I'm Dr.

18
00:00:58.507 --> 00:01:00.308
Dolittle. How can I help you?"

19
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.280
replied the gentle doctor.

20
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.781
"Something's wrong with this trouble maker.

21
00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:06.021
Fix him for me!"

22
00:01:06.482 --> 00:01:07.282
growled the man.

23
00:01:07.302 --> 00:01:09.242
"Please save me.

24
00:01:09.783 --> 00:01:13.544
My master is a bad man," the monkey begged.

25
00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:18.225
Dr. Dolittle was a gentle and kind man.

26
00:01:18.825 --> 00:01:22.026
But he did not like people who treated animals badly.

27
00:01:22.046 --> 00:01:25.787
"I will buy this monkey from you," Dr.

28
00:01:25.827 --> 00:01:27.667
Dolittle gave the man some coins.

29
00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:32.266
"He's stupid, you know," the man said, as he took the money.

30
00:01:32.286 --> 00:01:34.528
"No, sir.

31
00:01:35.168 --> 00:01:36.329
Animals aren't stupid.

32
00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.192
Humans are," the doctor spoke boldly.

33
00:01:39.212 --> 00:01:44.016
"What? Why you The man raised his fist.

34
00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:46.298
"Don't ever come back!"

35
00:01:46.818 --> 00:01:48.159
Dr. Dolittle ordered.

36
00:01:50.441 --> 00:01:53.984
Dr. Dolittle could not stand to see animals treated badly.

37
00:01:54.745 --> 00:01:58.208
He spent all his money buying them from their mean masters.

38
00:01:59.068 --> 00:02:01.770
Sarah, of course, was not happy at all.

39
00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:08.574
"If you keep buying more animals, we won't have any money left!"

40
00:02:09.075 --> 00:02:09.795
she argued.

41
00:02:09.815 --> 00:02:12.877
"Money is a headache," he sighed.

42
00:02:12.897 --> 00:02:19.442
"If you spend all the money," she warned, "I'll leave you and get married!"

43
00:02:21.423 --> 00:02:23.264
Once again, Sarah was right.

44
00:02:24.025 --> 00:02:24.845
Soon Dr.

45
00:02:24.865 --> 00:02:26.847
Dolittle didn't have any money left.

46
00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:31.085
Soon after that, Sarah did leave to get married.

47
00:02:31.105 --> 00:02:32.625
"Poor Dr.

48
00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.886
Dolittle," cried Gub-Gub.

49
00:02:37.066 --> 00:02:38.627
"What can we do to help him?"

50
00:02:39.227 --> 00:02:39.767
asked Jip.

51
00:02:40.427 --> 00:02:42.728
Chee-Chee, the monkey saved by Dr.

52
00:02:42.748 --> 00:02:43.948
Dolittle, spoke up.

53
00:02:44.568 --> 00:02:46.809
"We must take care of the housework."

54
00:02:47.309 --> 00:02:50.410
"That's a good idea," Polynesia agreed.

55
00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:55.471
"I like cooking," said Chee-Chee.

56
00:02:55.491 --> 00:02:58.332
"I can sweep the floors," Jip barked.

57
00:02:58.864 --> 00:03:00.305
"I'll take care of the beds!"

58
00:03:00.845 --> 00:03:01.766
quacked Dab-Dab.

59
00:03:01.786 --> 00:03:04.468
"Look how clean the windows are!"

60
00:03:04.988 --> 00:03:06.609
Gub-Gub shouted joyfully.

61
00:03:09.031 --> 00:03:11.893
Too-Too took care of the little money that was left.

62
00:03:12.613 --> 00:03:15.835
And Polynesia made sure that everything was done right.

63
00:03:15.855 --> 00:03:17.977
"Thank you all very much!

64
00:03:18.617 --> 00:03:21.239
The house looks so clean and tidy!"

65
00:03:21.839 --> 00:03:22.960
the doctor smiled.

66
00:03:24.821 --> 00:03:28.484
Even with the animals' help, it was hard to live without money.

67
00:03:29.372 --> 00:03:31.653
"Oh, I'm so cold!"

68
00:03:32.153 --> 00:03:33.073
cried Gub-Gub.

69
00:03:33.873 --> 00:03:35.354
"Doctor! Dr.

70
00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:38.135
Dolittle!" Chee-Chee burst through the door.

71
00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:41.656
"What is it, Chee-Chee?

72
00:03:41.936 --> 00:03:42.716
What's the matter?"

73
00:03:43.296 --> 00:03:45.497
Dr. Dolittle asked the shaking monkey.

74
00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:49.458
"My cousin cried Chee-Chee.

75
00:03:49.478 --> 00:04:01.026
"My cousin in Africa sickness all the monkeys sick dying "Tell me what's happened," Dr.

76
00:04:01.046 --> 00:04:02.307
Dolittle asked Chee-Chee.

77
00:04:02.327 --> 00:04:07.731
"There is a message for you from Africa," the monkey said slowly.

78
00:04:07.752 --> 00:04:09.793
"What kind of message?"

79
00:04:10.294 --> 00:04:11.274
asked Polynesia.

80
00:04:11.294 --> 00:04:13.797
"The monkeys are all sick.

81
00:04:14.217 --> 00:04:17.380
They beg for you to come," answered Chee-Chee.

82
00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.202
"Then I must go!"

83
00:04:20.702 --> 00:04:22.164
Dr. Dolittle stood up.

84
00:04:22.184 --> 00:04:23.665
"But how?

85
00:04:24.165 --> 00:04:27.840
You don't have any money," pointed out Too-Too.

86
00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.204
"We must go to Africa!

87
00:04:29.525 --> 00:04:30.848
Or the monkeys will die!"

88
00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:35.219
Dr. Dolittle and the animals stayed up all night thinking.
